        },
        {
          "text": " Kotemasi idwe luka Yosep Yosua atiar, “Kanukinyo kitebea ijo eoŋ eroet ediopet, ka atutubet adiopet araun airumeteka, kwabo kirai isio ituŋa luipu, naarai kisireren EJAKAIT sio kiton lolo?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
