        {
          "text": " Kotemasi idwe luka Yosep atiar, “Kikadit isio akwap nakiukon: Ikanaanin da kere luibojete kakwap naka aditot ejaas agalin nuka asua, ijul luejaas Bet-sean ka ireriake, ka nul da luejaas aditot naka Yesereel.” ",
